  </data>
  <data name="RulesScoringDescription" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>- Diagonals: Occupying two fields diagonally scores 20 points.
- Triplets: Occupying three consecutive fields horizontally or vertically scores a one-time 30-point bonus.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="RulesHowToPlayTitle" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>• How to Play</value>
  </data>
  <data name="RulesHowToPlayDescription" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>1. The game displays the first factor (the player's active color).
2. Select a second factor from the multiplier panel (numbers 1-9) at the bottom.
3. Calculate the product (Factor 1 × Factor 2) and locate it on the board.
4. Tap the cell with the correct product to claim it!
5. Note: Tapping a wrong cell or a cell that is already taken passes your turn.</value>
